{
  "name": "type-riot",
  "vibe": "Pure black ink (#141414), off-white paper and one riot red (#e63329) — no third colour anywhere. Anton stacks condensed uppercase headlines to the edges over Space Grotesk. The world is made of type: a giant ghost word scrolls behind everything at low contrast, a marquee rail runs the reserved band, and a hard red rule slams across on the beat. The only film here whose backdrop is language rather than landscape. Best for manifestos, music and culture, political and campaign work, streetwear drops and any brand that would rather shout than explain.",
